course: dictionary
lesson: 15542
title: Suntans and sun safety
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A suntan is the darker colour your skin turns after time in the sun. You can see it on your arms, face and legs. «Sam came home with a dark suntan after the day at the beach.»
explain: Many people think a suntan is healthy, but it is not. Your skin turns darker because the sun's UV rays have hurt it, and the skin is trying to protect itself. A suntan is a sign of damage, not good health.
explain: Suntan lotion, also called sunscreen, is a cream you put on your skin to stop it burning in the sun. «Mum put suntan lotion on my back before we went out.» In Australia and New Zealand, children learn «slip, slop, slap»: slip on a shirt, slop on sunscreen, slap on a hat.
fact: A suntan is the darker colour your skin goes after being in the sun.
fact: A suntan is a sign that the sun's UV rays have damaged your skin, not a sign of good health.
fact: «Suntan lotion» is a cream put on the skin to protect it from the sun. Here, suntan tells you what kind of lotion it is.
fact: Sunscreen protects skin from burning.
fact: «Slip, slop, slap» means slip on a shirt, slop on sunscreen and slap on a hat.
exercise: «Sam came home with a dark suntan after the day at the beach.» What is a suntan? | A type of swimsuit | *The darker colour skin goes after time in the sun | A cut that bleeds | A cold you catch in winter
exercise: Mum says «Put on your suntan lotion before we go out.» What does suntan lotion do? | Makes your hair curly | Keeps you warm in the snow | Stops you feeling hungry | *Protects your skin from burning in the sun
exercise: Your skin goes darker after the sun. What does this darker skin, a suntan, show? | Your bones are strong | You have been very clean | *Skin has been damaged by the sun | Your skin is very healthy
test: Which is the best way to protect your skin in the sun? | Lie in the sun for hours to get a suntan | Stay in the sun and wash in hot water | *Put on sunscreen, a shirt and a hat | Go out at midday with no cover
test: In «slip, slop, slap», what should you do for the slop? | *Put on sunscreen | Jump into the sea | Put on a shirt | Put on a hat
exam: Ella says her suntan proves her skin is healthy. What is the correct answer? | Yes, because brown skin is always strong | *No, a suntan shows the sun has hurt her skin | Yes, a suntan means healthy skin | No, a suntan is a type of food
